==Russian==
{{wikipedia|lang=ru}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|фоксал}} (obsolete)
* {{l|ru|воксал}} (obsolete)
* {{l|ru|воксгал}} (obsolete)

===Etymology===
Apparently from {{etyl|en|ru}} {{term|Vauxhall|lang=en}} (site of a pleasure garden and major railway station). Compare the spelling {{term|фоксал|lang=ru}} attested in 1777. The ending was influenced by {{term|зал||hall|lang=ru}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-вокзал.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|/vɐˈɡzal/|lang=ru}}

===Noun===
'''вокзал''' (vokzál) {{m}}

# {{context|obsolete|lang=ru}} [[park]], [[pleasure garden]]
#* '''1813''', Aleksandr Pushkin, ‘To Natalie’
#*: ''На гуляньях иль в '''воксалах''' / Легким зефиром летал.''  At fetes and in parks, I've been flitting like a gentle zephyr.
# [[train station]], [[railroad station]], [[railway station]], [[depot]]

